  "openPhoneSettings": "Open settings",
  "captureAlwaysTitle": "Location while Quincena is closed",
  "captureAlwaysBody": "Quincena collects location data to suggest the shop of a payment, even when the app is closed or not in use. It only looks at the location when a payment notification arrives, keeps it on this phone, and sends just the coordinates to OpenStreetMap, through Photon, to find the shop. Android will ask you to choose \"Allow all the time\".",
